                                                "example_id": "204ca331-ea5e-433f-b582-ffcd44426bb8",
                                                "sense_id": "aa1a05e0-767c-3eb4-a0bb-a26f047da067",
                                                "text": "The picture accompanying the article was in fact a screengrab of a video published by Reuters on 3 February and subsequently verified by the news agency’s fact check team, showing humanitarian workers lifting body bags in the Congolese city of Goma. The image was pulled from Reuters footage shot after deadly battles with Rwanda-backed M23 rebels."
                                            }
